      "updated": 1760000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Source of truth: infra/estate/messaging.bicep and the AppHost, and docs/architecture/events.md for the events each filter lets through. Every filter also passes a message resubmitted from the\nIntegration console to the subscription it was dead-lettered from. The Carrier-tracking and Carrier Proof of delivery Logic Apps read queues, not topics.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Source of truth: infra/estate/messaging.bicep and the AppHost, and docs/architecture/events.md for the events each filter lets through. Every filter also passes a message resubmitted from the\nIntegration console to the subscription it was dead-lettered from. The Carrier-tracking and Carrier Proof of delivery Logic Apps read queues, not topics.",
